        "id": 153113,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-15T15:40:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I would like to agree with you Pydro but other cards with similar wording have next in their wording and this doesn't which seems intentional. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Then I guess my question is what exactly is the intent? The intent seems to be very dertimental in very specific cases. What exploitable/powerful situation was to be avoided by this specific intent?</p>",
