      {
        "id": 153115,
        "name": "arenson9",
        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-15T15:59:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks everyone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Pydro, I liked your explanation of the 'intent' of the wording. It's well known that we need to take things literally in this game, and yet in this case I think you're spot on.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ronway, thanks for that test.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm convinced that the additional +1 wouldn't expire immediately, but last until the start of the next environment turn.&nbsp;</p>",
