      {
        "id": 153116,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-15T16:03:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The best test for me would be a card which just stay \"until the start of x turn\" and not \"until the start of next x turn\". &nbsp; Mistbound lists until the start of your next turn which is different from the wording on Exploit Vulnerabilty</p><p>edit: The Naturalist has cards which are \"until the start of your turn\" in Predator's eye and Threatening Stomp. &nbsp; Parse also has Targeting Arrow which is \"until start of your turn\". &nbsp; All other hero cards outside of those in the card spoiler sheet list \"until the start of your next turn\" which makes me wonder if more so of this was just a misprint and they should contain the word next as this only occurs with those two Vengeance heroes. &nbsp;Based on seeing that makes me more inclined to believe it should last until the next start of environment turn for Exploit Vulnerability.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:32:23.457Z",
